+| G8 | 40/40 relabelling/composition invariance checks, 40/40 carried witnesses, 20/20 unrelated keys distinct |
+| G9(c) | worst-case 763 characters, about 191 tokens, 174 atoms, 174 intended post-insight operations; all caps pass |
